   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\">you can set <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">x</code> and <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">y</code> positions manually in <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">geom_treescale</code>.  Besides, using <code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline\">+theme_grey()</code> is useful if you have no idea of the coordination.</p>\r\n<pre style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;font-size:1em;line-height:1.2em;margin:1.2em 0px\"><code style=\"font-size:0.85em;font-family:Consolas,Inconsolata,Courier,monospace;margin:0px 0.15em;padding:0px 0.3em;white-space:pre-wrap;border:1px solid rgb(234,234,234);background-color:rgb(248,248,248);border-radius:3px;display:inline;white-space:pre;overflow:auto;border-radius:3px;border:1px solid rgb(204,204,204);padding:0.5em 0.7em;display:block!important;display:block;overflow-x:auto;padding:0.5em;color:rgb(51,51,51);background:rgb(248,248,248) none repeat scroll 0% 0%\">set.seed(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">20180224</span>)\r\nx = rtree(<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">30</span>)\r\nggtree(x, layout=<span style=\"color:rgb(221,17,68)\">&#39;unrooted&#39;</span>) -&gt; p\r\np + ggplot2::theme_grey() + geom_treescale(x=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">7</span>, y=-<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">5.5</span>, offset=<span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128)\">.1</span>)\r\n</code></pre>\r\n<p style=\"margin:0px 0px 1.2em!important\"><img src=\"https://groups.google.com/group/bioc-ggtree/attach/17d516562f6c3/Screenshot%202018-02-24%2018.26.14.png?part=0.1&amp;view=1\" alt=\"Inline image 1\" width=\"516\" height=\"529\"></p>\r\n<div title=\"MDH:PGRpdj55b3UgY2FuIHNldCBgeGAgYW5kIGB5YCBwb3NpdGlvbnMgbWFudWFsbHkgaW4gYGdlb21f\r\ndHJlZXNjYWxlYC4mbmJzcDsgQmVzaWRlcywgdXNpbmcgYCt0aGVtZV9ncmV5KClgIGlzIHVzZWZ1\r\nbCBpZiB5b3UgaGF2ZSBubyBpZGVhIG9mIHRoZSBjb29yZGluYXRpb24uPGJyPjwvZGl2PjxkaXY+\r\nPGJyPmBgYHI8YnI+c2V0LnNlZWQoMjAxODAyMjQpPGJyPnggPSBydHJlZSgzMCk8YnI+Z2d0cmVl\r\nKHgsIGxheW91dD0ndW5yb290ZWQnKSAtJmd0OyBwPGJyPnAgKyBnZ3Bsb3QyOjp0aGVtZV9ncmV5\r\nKCkgKyBnZW9tX3RyZWVzY2FsZSh4PTcsIHk9LTUuNSwgb2Zmc2V0PS4xKTxicj5gYGA8YnI+PGJy\r\nPjxpbWcgc3JjPSJodHRwczovL21haWwuZ29vZ2xlLmNvbS9tYWlsL3UvMC8/dWk9MiZhbXA7aWs9\r\nZGQ4Mjg1ODM2NyZhbXA7dmlldz1maW1nJmFtcDt0aD0xNjFjNzVhYjNkMTZkNjlhJmFtcDthdHRp\r\nZD0wLjEmYW1wO2Rpc3A9ZW1iJmFtcDtyZWFsYXR0aWQ9aWlfMTYxYzc1YWIzZDE2ZDY5YSZhbXA7\r\nYXR0YmlkPUFOR2pkSi1aYTBqOHBPSFlXZHhpZEhzc3Ffck1kNHRLeFplZjZHeV9SVkxyMXg1VVh0\r\nY3YyY01NNU1aejB0bjhIOVVJMXlJZHduYkRRbDlxTWtnYV9HQkhZUVp0TTBaOUNFOEdxWHdhVDYx\r\ndG1fam50VHNTTm9EeHZQWGl2U28mYW1wO3N6PXMwLWw3NSZhbXA7YXRzPTE1MTk0NjgwNjU5MDgm\r\nYW1wO3JtPTE2MWM3NWFiM2QxNmQ2OWEmYW1wO3p3IiBkYXRhLXN1cmw9Imh0dHBzOi8vbWFpbC5n\r\nb29nbGUuY29tL21haWwvdS8wLz91aT0yJmFtcDtpaz1kZDgyODU4MzY3JmFtcDt2aWV3PWZpbWcm\r\nYW1wO3RoPTE2MWM3NWM3ZjViNmRhMjQmYW1wO2F0dGlkPTAuMSZhbXA7ZGlzcD1lbWImYW1wO3Jl\r\nYWxhdHRpZD1paV8xNjFjNzVhYjNkMTZkNjlhJmFtcDthdHRiaWQ9QU5HamRKOGVWa0pBWWhRQWxm\r\naGJidDRVOFpEMU1OS2JiZC12djI2VzY2bFVTN2ZvNFlvNzE4S3RMTWRINmVWQWVlRVlqOG5FQ1Z1\r\nc1VaZzZBU194eWVQYlFkYUJxNEljODVEc2NYbmxWTEpTbk5abkp0S3Z3UnR5Ulk5QV9HWSZhbXA7\r\nc3o9czAtbDc1JmFtcDthdHM9MTUxOTQ2O